<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3358339639"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6814726254"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Now and Never"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TIC / Paperman"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Now and Never"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:13.333"><div begin="00:00.001" end="02:13.333"><p begin="00:00.001" end="00:00.001" itunes:key="L1">作曲 : TIC<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知光阴流转</span></p><p begin="00:00.002" end="00:05.009" itunes:key="L2">I know that in time</p><p begin="00:05.010" end="00:12.049" itunes:key="L3">I'll get over you and I know that in time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我终将前行</span></p><p begin="00:12.050" end="00:47.999" itunes:key="L4">I'll get over you, over you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我终将远行</span></p><p begin="00:48.000" end="00:55.039" itunes:key="L5">You shine light on me and just for a moment my world disappears<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天光倾泻，覆我周身</span></p><p begin="00:55.040" end="00:58.066" itunes:key="L6">Rising up high like the sea and just for a moment, and just for</p><p begin="00:58.067" end="01:00.041" itunes:key="L7">And just for a moment<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如海潮升，直抵苍穹</span></p><p begin="01:00.042" end="01:01.086" itunes:key="L8">And just for..<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我已释然</span></p><p begin="01:01.087" end="01:04.999" itunes:key="L9">I know that in time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将前行，不息</span></p><p begin="01:05.000" end="01:05.076" itunes:key="L10">I'll get</p><p begin="01:05.077" end="01:07.076" itunes:key="L11">I'll carry on, I'll carry on</p><p begin="01:07.077" end="01:11.076" itunes:key="L12">I know that in time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因我深信，在光阴里</span></p><p begin="01:11.077" end="01:13.076" itunes:key="L13">I'll carry on, I'll carry on</p><p begin="01:13.077" end="01:47.056" itunes:key="L14">In time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知时序流转处</span></p><p begin="01:47.057" end="01:51.046" itunes:key="L15">I know that in time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我终将前行，直至远方</span></p><p begin="01:51.047" end="01:53.056" itunes:key="L16">I'll carry on, I'll carry on</p><p begin="01:53.057" end="01:57.046" itunes:key="L17">I know that in time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知逝者如斯夫</span></p><p begin="01:57.047" end="01:59.056" itunes:key="L18">I'll carry on, I'll carry on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知光阴渡我</span></p><p begin="01:59.057" end="02:13.333" itunes:key="L19">In time</p></div></body></tt>